==Trivia==
This card is one of several featured in the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion's "Safari Zone" [[Genetic Apex (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]], all of which can be found in the [[Kanto Safari Zone]] in Generations {{gen|I}} and {{gen|III}}.

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Exeggcute|1}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*{{m|Seed Bomb}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Exeggcute}} can learn via [[Move Tutor]], or via [[TM]] in [[Generation IX]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

